If You have purchased a subscription or license to the TextQL platform
under a separately executed agreement with TextQL or one of its affiliates
(a "Master Agreement"), the terms of that Master Agreement prevail over
this Agreement to the extent of any conflict. This offering is Bring Your
Own License (BYOL): a valid commercial subscription from TextQL, including
the deployment credentials TextQL issues with it, is required for the AI
and analytics functionality of the Software.

